For documents involving the Bharatiya Nyaya Sanhita, Bharatiya Nagarik Suraksha Sanhita and Bharatiya Sakshya Adhiniyam, retain their actual provisions and effective legal context.

Provide a separate mapping facility for related provisions where a reliable statutory cross-reference exists. Do not invent direct equivalents where the legislative changes are not equivalent.

A legal researcher must be able to see whether a judgment interprets an earlier provision or a current enactment. This distinction is essential.

