The system should distinguish the person's actual name from a document filename and distinguish an academic qualification from a professional licence or enrolment.

Only information reviewed and approved by an authorised administrator should become publicly visible.

## 57. Firm information

Support the management of firm history, office details, approved contact information, practice-area descriptions, professional announcements and website content.

Do not invent office addresses, telephone numbers, lawyer identities, operating hours or other factual details.

Use the actual approved profile records already available in the application.

